        <mxCell id="fES8XVC7SDmJghBYlBLF-66" parent="fES8XVC7SDmJghBYlBLF-12" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b1ddf0;strokeColor=#10739e;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-lucid-content=&quot;{&amp;quot;t&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Only the points of 2 cameras are triangulated. We project these 3Dpts in 2D cameras systems (the other) and we compare with the inital 2Dpts detected. We fix the 3D points by reducing the error &amp;quot;,&amp;quot;m&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;s&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;n&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;p&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;v&amp;quot;:1.2},{&amp;quot;s&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;n&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;a&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;v&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;center&amp;quot;},{&amp;quot;s&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;n&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;s&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;v&amp;quot;:22.44444444444444,&amp;quot;e&amp;quot;:194},{&amp;quot;s&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;n&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;c&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;v&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;3a414aff&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;e&amp;quot;:194},{&amp;quot;s&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;n&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;fsp&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;v&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ss_presetShapeStyle1_textStyle&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;e&amp;quot;:194}]}&quot; data-lucid-type=&quot;application/vnd.lucid.text&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16.8333px; color: rgb(58, 65, 74);&quot;&gt;Only the points of 2 cameras are triangulated. We project these 3Dpts in 2D cameras systems (the other) and we compare with the inital 2Dpts detected. We fix the 3D points by reducing the error &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
